m-3099-multicheckbox-1-2\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Microsoft Teams\"/> <span>Microsoft Teams</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-3\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-3\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Besuch der ZOLLER Smart Factory\"/> <span>Visita alla ZOLLER Smart Factory</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-4\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-4\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Schulungen\"/> <span>Formazioni</span> </label> </div> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-5\"> <input id=\"mainContactform-3099-multicheckbox-1-5\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][multicheckbox-1][]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"Dienstleistung\"/> <span>Servizio</span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-textarea-1\">Il vostro messaggio</label> <div class=\"input\"> <textarea class=\"xxlarge form-control\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-textarea-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][textarea-1]\"></textarea> </div> </div> </fieldset> <fieldset class=\"form-group\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-fieldset-2\"> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-2\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-2]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-2\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-2]\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>Desidero iscrivermi alla newsletter.</span> </label> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"input checkbox\"> <div class=\"form-check\"> <label class=\"add-on form-check-label\" for=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-1\"> <input name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/><input class=\"add-on\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-checkbox-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][checkbox-1]\" required=\"required\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/> <span>Acconsentite che i dati inseriti sopra vengano utilizzati per elaborare la vostra richiesta a fini commerciali e trasmessi alle sedi commerciali competenti o ai rappresentanti commerciali. Potete opporvi al trattamento dei vostri dati in qualsiasi momento e senza indicarne il motivo scrivendo a datenschutz@zoller.info. <span class=\"required\">*</span> </span> </label> </div> </div> </div> </fieldset> <div class=\"form-group\"> <div class=\"recaptcha\"> <input data-recaptcha-form-field=\"\" id=\"mainContactform-3099-recaptcha-1\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][recaptcha-1]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"\"/> <div class=\"g-recaptcha\" data-callback=\"onRecaptchaCallback\" data-error-callback=\"onRecaptchaError\" data-expired-callback=\"onRecaptchaExpired\" data-sitekey=\"6LcINbosAAAAAH8zSxnwOP319AslujYzyd6BWf7L\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"actions\"> <nav class=\"form-navigation\"> <div class=\"btn-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\"> <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\"> <span class=\"btn-group next submit\"> <button class=\"block-button\" name=\"tx_form_formframework[mainContactform-3099][__currentPage]\" type=\"submit\" value=\"1\"> Invia e-mail </button> </span> </div> </div> </nav> </div> </form>",
